---
layout: base.njk
title: Contact
permalink: /contact/
description: "Write to Lou Massett about Traddyland, interviews, speaking, or your own story."
---
<div class="wrap page-head">
  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <p class="lede">For interviews, speaking, book clubs, or to tell Lou your own story. Everything goes to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
</div>
<section class="band" style="padding-top:1.5rem">
  <div class="wrap two-col top">
    <form class="form" action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" data-thanks="Thank you. Your message is on its way, and Lou will reply soon.">
<input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="{{ site.web3formsKey }}">
      <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="Message from traddyland.com">
      <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="{{ site.url }}/thanks/">
      <label>Name <input type="text" name="name" required></label>
      <label>Email <input type="email" name="email" required></label>
      <label>This is about
        <select name="topic"><option>An interview or podcast</option><option>A speaking invitation</option><option>A book club or reading group</option><option>My own story</option><option>Something else</option></select>
      </label>
      <label>Message <textarea name="message" rows="6" required></textarea></label>
      <button class="btn" type="submit">Send</button>
    </form>
    <div class="prose">
      <div class="contact-ways">
        <a class="cway" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" d="M3 6h18v12H3z"/><path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" d="m3 7 9 6 9-6"/></svg><span><small>Email</small>{{ site.email }}</span></a>
        {%- if site.phone %}<a class="cway" href="tel:+1{{ site.phone | replace("-", "") }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 3h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 6 6L16 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 3 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"/></svg><span><small>Phone</small>{{ site.phone }}</span></a>{% endif %}
        <a class="cway" href="{{ site.telegram or '/community/' }}"{% if site.telegram %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 4 3 11l6 2.5L18 7l-7 8 6.5 5z"/></svg><span><small>Reader community</small><b>Traddyland Readers on Telegram{% if not site.telegram %} <em class="soon">Coming soon</em>{% endif %}</b></span></a>
      </div>
      <h3>If you were raised in the Society</h3>
      <p>A lot of the mail Lou gets is from people who were raised in the Society or a movement like it and have never said so out loud. Those letters are read first and answered personally. Nothing you write is shared.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
